uck can tow if it's capacity allows, and the motorbike can wheelie!\r\nThis program was written using typescript JS.", "created_at": "2025-01-30T04:39:58Z", "repo": "vehicle-builder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "80f0c74b419ad275c359379335b09076f095d7eb", "message": "uploading code to git", "created_at": "2025-01-30T00:23:53Z", "repo": "vehicle-builder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}], "prs": []}